Two tips for the routing:

- **Use your crater marks as obstacles.** Each crater in `craters.csv` has a position and radius, so a route can treat each circle (plus a safety margin) as no-go.
- **The route-finding code I wrote earlier can be reused.** The `findPath` function in the `app.js` from this chat does this on a grid; your friend can adapt it by marking grid cells inside crater circles as blocked.

